{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名どおり結論から言えば\n二日間私はおうちに帰らなかったです。"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-01@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(๑́•∀•๑̀)ฅﾃﾍ-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日目は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山一実"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢漢字あってるよね？｣"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野七瀬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの四人で仕事終わりご飯食べに行ってそのまま七瀬ちゃん家に泊まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃん家のまあやのフェイバリットゾーンはＴＶの向かい側にあるソファーです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パジャマとか何も持っていかなかったので次の日の服も全部用意してくれました‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前からお泊りおいで～って言ってくてれたので行けて嬉しい～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ƭʜᵃℕҡ ყօϋ୨୧ᐝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-07@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝まあやの方が先に仕事で出ちゃうんだけど、\n起こさないように準備して出るときだけ行ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-08@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったらわざわざ眠たい目を擦りながら起きてお見送りしてくれたの～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-09@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-10@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして次の日の仕事が終わったら\nまた同じメンバーで次はかずみん家に行きました..."},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-11@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出前とか頼んでまったりこたつでくつろぎました(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡\nかずみんが昨日の残りのお鍋食べる？って言ってくれていただきました～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-13@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-13@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-13@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味しみてて美味しかったなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"(๑´ㅂ`๑)ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこんなでとっても楽しい二日間を過ごしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二日間帰らないのはちょっと不良になったちゃったなぁ...っと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-16@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも遊んでくれた愛未ちゃん、かずみん、なぁちゃんありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-09@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しわわせいっぱい(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんと～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッション誌CUTiEに出させて頂きます～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉し～‼️\n是非チェックしてね～\n=͟͟͞͞=͟͟͞͞=͟͟͞͞=͟͟͞͞))ु˃̶͈̀ω˂̶͈́ )੭ु⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして11日はお父さんの大切な誕生日でもあり\n東北大震災の日ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も明後日も皆が笑顔で幸せでありますように\n自分に何ができるのか考えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、7５５に関してですが、\n春休み入ったらやろうと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援やアドバイス‥心配してもらえて‥\nありがとうチャレンジしてみるね\nもし良かったらチェックしてくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-21@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月３日握手会が完売したよ～！ってコメント見てビックリ‼︎皆、本当にありがとうございます‼️\n沢山のメンバーの中で、まあやに会いに来てくれて‥ありがとう    嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃったけど、birthdayLIVEの時も\nお花をありがとうございました。❤️❤️\n写真撮れなかったのが残念でしかたない‥涙\n誰か撮ってないかな～‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ⓗ⃞ⓐ⃞ⓟ⃞ⓟ⃞ⓨ⃞ ᵕ̈*Ⓑ⃞ⓘ⃞ⓡ⃞ⓣ⃞ⓗ⃞ⓓ⃞ⓐ⃞ⓨ⃞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢は大人なのにお顔は赤ちゃんだね\nまあやはまりっかのこと携帯にオッさん！って入れてるよ 笑\nだって食べ物とかおつまみ好きでしょ⁉︎\nだからだよ～笑\nオッさんの名前は変える事は多分ないよっ\nでもね、オシャレで可愛いまりっか大スキなんだぁ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直あーちゃんが同級生には思えません。だってお顔がベビーフェイスなんだもん\n最近ショートの仲間入りして仲間増えてうれちぃ秋田から通ってるの大変だと思うけど頑張ってねまあやも広島から通ってた時期があったからなんでも相談してねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本奈々未"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんはまあやと味覚も体の柔らかい所硬い所、ホクロの位置、骨格が似てるねってよく話します。沢山似てるね所があってうれしいよーまた物理とか数学教えてちょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３人ともだぁ～～いスキ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返ししてなかったのと、誕生日のお祝いします*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.397 かほたろす さんへ\n5年間部活お疲れ様でした。素敵な後輩さんだね～(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.341 包帯男 さんへ\n負けたくないのは‥自分‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.214 のひ さんへ\n2月10日お誕生日おめでとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ183 あき さんへ\n福山の鞆の浦もいいよ～(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ79 砂漠のフランソワ さんへ\n2月22日お誕生日おめでとう～乃木坂のお誕生日と一緒だね～(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.390 まいったん さんへ\n団扇は、お母さんも大っきな まあや団扇見た～！って言ってたから\nもしかしたら、まいったんさんかな⁉︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.356 乃木坂箱推しぞう さんへ\n2月26日お誕生日おめでとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.328 こぞさんへ\n3月2日お誕生日おめでとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.320 イワノフ さんへ\n2月23日お誕生日おめでとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.244 ひよこり さんへ\n2月24日お誕生日おめでとう～(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.101 ぐるカー1番 さんへ\n4月20日でお仕事終わりなんですね\nお疲れ様でした。\n後少しですね、終わったら少しはゆっくりできるんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.9 やんしお さんへ3月21日 18才のお誕生日おめでとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.319 ぶー（旧姓 いわみかぐら）さんへ\n3月11日お誕生日おめでとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.312 ぴゅあ さんへ\n3月13日お誕生日おめでとう～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.247 キューピー さんへ\n少し休んだら沢山美味しい物を食べて\n一緒に頑張ろう～*\\(^o^)/*\n応援してるよ\n宮島に行ったら、鹿さんに気を付けてね 笑\n鹿煎餅を買ったら直ぐにくるよ～笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月20日\n橋本奈々未 ななみ～ん(^O^)\n伊藤万理華 まりっか～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月5日\n鈴木絢音ちゃん～(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃったけど、\nお誕生日おめでとう～*\\(^o^)/*\n素敵な1年になりますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影会来てくれてありがとう～‼︎\nすっごく楽しかったよ～\n写真が大切な思い出になりますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はチェキ会、クルージングだねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに待ってる～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0020.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}